10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是有限极限范畴。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p=\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B^{\\to}}\">\\(\\chi=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B^{\\to}}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83660625186c7ee3\" href=\"?note=83660625186c7ee3\" title=\"16-df-codomain-fibration\">16-df-codomain-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LCCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"11ad48f63b554ca7\" href=\"?note=11ad48f63b554ca7\" title=\"16-df-lccc\">16-df-lccc</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明（正向）：闭理解的纤维闭性由 Proposition 10.5.4 给出；余域纤维是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B/I\">\\(\\mathcal B/I\\)</span>，所以每个切片 CCC。</li>\n<li>证明（反向）：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(I)=\\operatorname{id}_I\">\\(T(I)=\\operatorname{id}_I\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\dashv\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(T\\dashv\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 给出单位理解；满忠实性由恒等理解函子立即得到。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to I\">\\(f:X\\to I\\)</span> 的左伴随是复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\mapsto fg\">\\(g\\mapsto fg\\)</span>，比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是恒等，故和强。LCCC 中拉回函子的右伴随给出依赖积。左右 BC 分别由拉回粘贴及依赖积的 Hom 泛性质得到。</li>\n<li>原文件对任意理解结构声称三项等价，且倒写伴随方向；这里改为书中 Theorem 10.5.5(ii) 的准确情形。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-codomain-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"83660625186c7ee3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-codomain-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lccc","status":"resolved","id":"11ad48f63b554ca7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-lccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc","status":"resolved","id":"03e3216b8128fbcd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-codomain-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"83660625186c7ee3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p=\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B^{\\to}}$，见 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lccc","status":"resolved","id":"11ad48f63b554ca7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-lccc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B^{\\to}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B/I","display":false},{"tex":"T(I)=\\operatorname{id}_I","display":false},{"tex":"T\\dashv\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"g\\mapsto fg","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1823,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-402","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv|thm-closed-comprehension-equivalence — 余域理解与 LCCC]]"},{"id":"60a2ae7d955cfe55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为有限极限范畴，$\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B$；$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{LCCC}$ 及证明见 [[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv]]。"}],"outgoing":["3015a5a145e2e498","83660625186c7ee3","11ad48f63b554ca7","03e3216b8128fbcd"]}